"Sales, orders, profit and customer figures use your full WooCommerce order "
"history."
msgstr ""
"Cijfers voor verkopen, bestellingen, winst en klanten gebruiken uw volledige "
"WooCommerce-orderhistorie."

#. translators: %s: date BrikPanel was activated.
#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:560
#, php-format
