#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:688
msgid "What Expenses includes"
msgstr "Wat Uitgaven omvat"

#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:689
msgid ""
"Operating costs for the period: order tax, ad spend from connected ad "
"platforms (store currency only), supplier and stock costs from received "
"purchase orders, plus anything logged in the Expenses module. Open the "
"breakdown to see each part."
msgstr ""
"Bedrijfskosten voor de periode: orderbelasting, advertentie-uitgaven van "
"gekoppelde advertentieplatforms (alleen winkelvaluta), leveranciers- en "
"voorraadkosten van ontvangen inkooporders, plus alles wat in de module "
"Uitgaven is geregistreerd. Open de uitsplitsing om elk onderdeel te zien."

